<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta’s air force has continued striking civilian sites, killing a pregnant woman in Mrauk-U and a Muslim youth in an IDP camp at Wirathani, while resistance forces captured three military outposts near the Sagaing-Kachin border. Drone strikes have hit the Tada-U airbase, expanding aerial tactics, and landmines block displaced residents from returning to northern Kawkareik. The military is courting U.S. rare-earth investment to reduce dependence on China, while China seeks green stones from Myanmar, and the conflict is being fueled by a Middle East energy shock that intensifies competition for crude. 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOeGRlYnlQbHM3T3hGeWNXdHpuWWNnejNxWmVnbE1UTE1QLXFTa1BKRW9UUTdZTTJiQkxPVXR4cldabHRzdW9GUl9MbjF3YmR6czB4MUhiVWd0WFJyNXBXdVZ5U2lJdkJVOHZTMWVBY3oxbUtId1UxdENLNUVPYW1iUE5ROEpITjN1SmEzcUhuQjNBbXNiRzFYc3AwMkVRRUNnVVRxSTNOOVVVUHl0V3pGNmFLYXIwOUZY?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxQWE9rT3ZGMVFIa25kN3dBMVdRcm00bVNtQkJLN1dzaGE5QVhjWkxKNF9JTjNrV3Y4TjBkLW9OUkpXblN3Mi1uQk5yVFZWaHVaMWZlRUpGN29oY2lKUTRJdWtiNDBjRVdlSGFTcTZUVEtWMU45VHhMMnhaVHUxTWtXMm81c3Jxb0NGa09KUXpmdlZKUUxiT0dZLTFVbGprNmsyWi1aWVk2ZE9zckp2cXZZRnFzQTJHZkhOdjFXMktxQ3k2Y0U?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Irrawaddy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxOcVdldno3c1oxS2poVHEzMGZveExIUHBsMDI4VWtYTnZWYW1BLXlnY0FTWWJRbzRCbFhtU1V5MjdVZ3BnZDZHdi1NanlHS3FZNXFnX2pYWHVJSm96VjVUbnJrMExORmtOdmwxMFlQWkN3djNPMExVblNYY0RsOWtkVldCQUlnLV9uS3RrSEtWVFpPRjBGWE5XQWdFX2gzT2ktSmM5T1Rndi0?oc=5&quot;&gt;Karen News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxQbF